!README.md
# ...except these two — read from disk at runtime (LlmChatClient's system
# prompt, and the RAG knowledge base source), not just documentation. A
# deploy built from a git checkout (e.g. Render) is missing them entirely
# without this, so every chat message 500s on fs.readFileSync ENOENT.
!packages/ai/prompts/assistant.md
!packages/ai/knowledge/faq.md
